<title>USA: Vinik group has 6.5 percent of Mail-Well.</title>
<headline>Vinik group has 6.5 percent of Mail-Well.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Boston investor Jeffrey Vinik said it has acquired 806,400 shares of Mail-Well Inc., or 6.5 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it acquired the stake for investment purposes for about $13.3 million.</p>
<p>The group said it bought a net 673,400 of the shares between Dec. 2 and Feb. 7 at prices ranging from $13.875 to $18.0348 a share.</p>
